msgid "Erle-Brain 2 is compatible with PPM-Sum RC receivers. For traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a `PPM encoder <http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/catalog/62753.jpg>`__ can be used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM."
